==Strategy==
It is recommended to use '''[[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]]''' like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and any good midrangers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]]. Use Roe to halt Bore to let your main DPS take care of him. Make sure to also have a unit to deal with Mr. Mole, such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]].

Furthermore, anti-traitless units like the elusive [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Girlfriend Cat]] and [[Brainwashed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Flying Cat]] make fighting Mr. Mole MUCH easier, the latter's wave being better for damage and pierce.

